    <decisions>
        <description>To ensure that at least one active agent is present in the queue, the system will route to that agent if available. If no agents are present, the bot will display a message indicating that no agents are visible.</description>
        <name>Is_Agent_Available</name>
        <label>Is Agent Available</label>
        <locationX>895</locationX>
        <locationY>491</locationY>
        <defaultConnectorLabel>Default Outcome</defaultConnectorLabel>
        <rules>
            <name>Yes</name>
            <conditionLogic>and</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>Check_Agent_Availbility.onlineAgentsCount</leftValueReference>
                <operator>GreaterThanOrEqualTo</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <numberValue>1.0</numberValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector>
                <targetReference>Routing_to_Agent</targetReference>
            </connector>
            <label>Yes</label>
        </rules>
    </decisions>
    <description>This flow will be called from the bot. When the customer wants to connect with an agent, it will route to the respective agents if the agent is online. Based on language selection, it will route to the queue.
+ Latam + UKI + India  + Ironmountain.com Conditions
#24473 - Updated the Case origin Formula and Chat Queues for APAC region.</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <formulas>
        <description>Utilized for queue routing.</description>
        <name>varQueue</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>IF(
    AND(
        ISBLANK({!varCustomerWantsToChat}),
        {!varChannelName} = &quot;IronMountainWebsite Messaging Channel&quot;
    ),
    &quot;Chat_Agents_Sales_and_Marketing_Queue&quot;,
    IF(
        AND(
            {!varChannelName} = &quot;IronMountainWebsite Messaging Channel&quot;,
            OR(
               {!varSelectedLanguage} = &quot;English&quot;,
                {!varSelectedLanguage} = &quot;English (US)&quot;
            )
        ),
        &quot;Chat_Agents_Service_Team_Queue&quot;,
        IF(
            AND(
               {!varChannelName} = &quot;IronMountainWebsite Messaging Channel&quot;,
                {!varSelectedLanguage} = &quot;French&quot;
            ),
            &quot;NAS_Quebec_Chat&quot;,
            CASE(
               {!varSelectedLanguage},
                &quot;English&quot;,
                CASE(
                    {!varCustomerType},
                    &quot;Guest&quot;, &quot;IRM_Customer_Community_Chat_Queue&quot;,
                    &quot;Authenticated&quot;, &quot;NAS_IMCSS_chat&quot;,
                    &quot;IRM_Customer_Community_Chat_Queue&quot;
                ),
                &quot;French&quot;, 
                CASE(
                    {!varCustomerType},
                    &quot;Guest&quot;, &quot;NAS_Quebec_Chat&quot;,
                    &quot;Authenticated&quot;, &quot;NAS_Quebec_Chat&quot;,
                    &quot;NAS_Quebec_Chat&quot;
                ),
                &quot;Colombia&quot;,&quot;IMLA_COL_Service_Chat&quot;,
                &quot;Argentina&quot;,&quot;IMLA_ARG_Service_Chat&quot;,
                &quot;Brazil&quot;,&quot;IMLA_BRA_Service_Chat&quot;,
                &quot;Mexico&quot;,&quot;IMLA_MEX_Service_Chat&quot;,
                &quot;Peru&quot;,&quot;IMLA_PER_Service_Chat&quot;,
                &quot;Chile&quot;,&quot;IMLA_CHL_Service_Chat&quot;,
                &quot;English (UK)&quot;, &quot;UKI_IMConnect&quot;,
                &quot;English (IN)&quot;, &quot;India_Chat_queue&quot;,
                 &quot;English (PH)&quot;, &quot;PHL_Chat&quot;,
		  &quot;English (SG)&quot;, &quot;SGP_Chat&quot;,
		  &quot;English (MY)&quot;, &quot;MYS_Chat&quot;,
                &quot;&quot;
            )
        )
    )
)</expression>
    </formulas>
